# ClickUp Internal Team Clone - Environment Configuration

# 1. Local Development (Default):
# Zero config required. The app automatically creates and uses local `file:clickup.db`.

# 2. Vercel Production Deployment (Serverless Persistent SQLite):
# Create a free database at https://turso.tech (Free tier: 500 databases, 9GB storage, zero sleep)
# Add these two variables in your Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables:
TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://your-database-name-your-org.turso.io
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=your-turso-auth-token

# 3. Optional: PostgreSQL / Supabase
# If you prefer PostgreSQL over SQLite, you can use the schema in replica/schema.sql
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:password@db.your-project.supabase.co:5432/postgres
